          "archivo": "Form1.frm",
          "codigo": "Dim paso As Integer\n\nPrivate Sub cmdDisminuir_Click()\n    If Image1.Width > paso And Image1.Height > paso Then\n        Image1.Width = Image1.Width - paso\n        Image1.Height = Image1.Height - paso\n    End If\nEnd Sub\n\nPrivate Sub Form_Load()\n\n    paso = 150\nEnd Sub\n\n\nPrivate Sub cmdArriba_Click()\n    Image1.Top = Image1.Top - paso\nEnd Sub\n\nPrivate Sub cmdAbajo_Click()\n    Image1.Top = Image1.Top + paso\nEnd Sub\n\nPrivate Sub cmdIzquierda_Click()\n    Image1.Left = Image1.Left - paso\nEnd Sub\n\nPrivate Sub cmdDerecha_Click()\n    Image1.Left = Image1.Left + paso\nEnd Sub\n\n\n\nPrivate Sub cmdAumentaar_Click()\n    Image1.Width = Image1.Width + paso\n    Image1.Height = Image1.Height + paso\nEnd Sub\n\n\n\n\n\nPrivate Sub cmdSaalir_Click()\n    Unload Me\n\nEnd Sub"
