          "codigo": "Private Sub Command1_Click()\nIf Command1.Caption = \"Nuevo Producto\" Then\nData1.Recordset.AddNew\nText1.Enabled = True\nText2.Enabled = True\nText3.Enabled = True\nCommand1.Caption = \"Guardar Producto\"\nCommand1.BackColor = vbYellow\n\n\nElse\nIf Command1.Caption = \"Guardar Producto\" Then\nOn Error Resume Next\nData1.Recordset.Update\nData1.Recordset.MoveLast\nMsgBox \"Se guardo exitosamente nuevo producto\", vbInformation\nText1.Enabled = False\nText2.Enabled = False\nText3.Enabled = False\nCommand1.Caption = \"Nuevo Producto\"\nCommand1.BackColor = vbGreen\n\nEnd If\nEnd If\nEnd Sub\n\nPrivate Sub Command2_Click()\nOn Error Resume Next\nData1.Recordset.Delete\nOn Error Resume Next\nData1.Recordset.MoveNext\nIf Data1.Recordset.EOF Then\nData1.Recordset.MoveFirst\nEnd If\nEnd Sub\n\nPrivate Sub Command3_Click()\nForm1.Show\nUnload Me\nEnd Sub\n\nPrivate Sub Command4_Click()\nData1.Recordset.MovePrevious\nIf Data1.Recordset.BOF Then\nData1.Recordset.MoveLast\nEnd If\n\nEnd Sub\n\nPrivate Sub Command5_Click()\nData1.Recordset.MoveNext\nIf Data1.Recordset.EOF Then\nData1.Recordset.MoveFirst\nEnd If\nEnd Sub\n\nPrivate Sub Command6_Click()\nForm5.Show\nEnd Sub\n\nPrivate Sub Form_Load()\n    On Error Resume Next\n    Data1.DatabaseName = App.Path & \"\\sellpoint.mdb\"\n    Data1.Refresh\nEnd Sub"
